e transport of the cationic amino acids (L-arginine, L-lysine, L-ornithine and L-homoarginine)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}